  "releaseNotes": "RO-Crate rework (https://github.com/nfdi4plants/ARCtrl/pull/496)\nAdditions:\nMerge pull request #502 from nfdi4plants/datamap_rocrate\nmake file paths from datamap absolute in RO-Crate\nstart working on Datamap RO-Crate parser\nMerge pull request #496 from nfdi4plants/ld-object-context\nadded doi and pubmed helper functions to LDPropertyValue and LDScholarlyArticle converters\nbump to 2.4.0\nBugfixes:\nadd fixed propertyID to RO-Crate Fragment Descriptor\nsmall fixes and adjustments for ro-crate export\nupdate ro-crate testfile with datamap and small fix\nadd ro_crate conversion tests and fixes\nadd tests and fixes for datamap RO-Crate conversion\nreinclude isaprofile types and prefix static class names with LD",
